SENI-142 — DUAL OPEN LICENSE
===============================================================================
Benchmark: SENI-142: An Open-Access Resilient Insular Transmission Benchmark
of the Dominican Republic with Diakoptic Territorial Decomposition under
Spatial Planning Law 368-22.
Manuscript: TPWRS-SENI-142-2026 (IEEE Transactions on Power Systems).
Author: Ing. Junior Alexis Villanueva Rosario, Ms.C., Ph.D.(c) — sole author.
Archival DOI (concept): 10.5281/zenodo.23484704
Repository: https://github.com/Junvillan/seni142-benchmark

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. SCOPE — TWO LICENSES, TWO OBJECTS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This release is distributed under two separate open licenses, one for each
class of artefact. There is no single monolithic grant and no "all rights
reserved" component.

  (a) THE DATA — the network model, the topology, the census tables, the
      contingency catalogue, the released matrices, the manuscript and its
      compiled forms, and the numerical data tables carried inside
      `case142_seni.m` — is licensed under the

          Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
          SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0

  (b) THE CODE — the verification harness, the mutation-robustness suite and
      the MATPOWER-case verifier — is licensed under the

          Apache License, Version 2.0
          SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Attribution is required under (a) and (b) alike. Section 4 below maps every
artefact of this release to its licence and its SPDX identifier.

